<view class="page"><view class="safe-top"/><view class="topbar"><view><view class="brand">风里有约</view><view class="brand-sub">MY WEEKENDS</view></view></view><block wx:if="{{!editing}}"><view class="profile-hero"><view class="avatar"><image wx:if="{{profile.avatar_file_id}}" src="{{profile.avatar_file_id}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else>{{profileInitial}}</text></view><view><view class="profile-name">{{profile.nickname}}</view><view class="profile-meta">{{profile.city}} · {{profile.pace}}</view><view class="profile-bio">{{profile.bio}}</view></view><button class="profile-edit" bindtap="edit">编辑</button></view><view class="profile-counts"><view><b>{{plans.length}}</b><text>我的安排</text></view><view><b>{{invitations.length}}</b><text>我的邀约</text></view><view><b>私密</b><text>记录默认</text></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view><text class="section-kicker">MY PLANS</text><view class="section-heading">我的出行安排</view></view></view><block wx:if="{{plans.length}}"><block wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="_id"><view class="plan-card"><view data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="open"><text class="status-pill">{{item.status==='active'?'正在路上':item.status==='scheduled'?'已经安排':'待安排'}}</text><view class="plan-title">{{item.route_snapshot.title}}</view><view class="facts">{{item.scheduled_at||'还没有安排时间。想去的时候，给自己约一个下午。'}}</view></view><button class="text-link plan-share" data-id="{{item._id}}" loading="{{sharingPlanId===item._id}}" bindtap="share">分享这次安排　→</button></view></block></block><view wx:else class="empty">还没有出行安排。<br/>从一条路线开始，给周末留一个小约定。</view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view><text class="section-kicker">SHARED BY ME</text><view class="section-heading">我分享的安排</view></view></view><block wx:if="{{sharedRoutes.length}}"><block wx:for="{{sharedRoutes}}" wx:key="_id"><button class="paper-card mini-invite" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="openShared"><b>{{item.title}}</b><text>独立公开路线 · 不展示你的具体时间和位置　→</text></button></block></block><view wx:else class="empty">你分享的是独立路线，不等于邀请别人同行。<br/>先从一条自己的安排开始。</view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view><text class="section-kicker">MY INVITATIONS</text><view class="section-heading">我发起或加入的同行</view></view></view><block wx:if="{{invitations.length}}"><block wx:for="{{invitations}}" wx:key="_id"><button class="paper-card mini-invite" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="chat"><b>{{item.route.title}}</b><text>{{item.start_time}} · 进入本次群聊　→</text></button></block></block><view wx:else class="empty">还没有同行邀约。<br/>先从自己的一个计划开始吧。</view></view></block><block wx:else><view class="page-title">编辑我的主页</view><view class="page-copy">这些信息只用来让你的主页更像你；出行计划与私密记录不会自动公开。</view><view class="form-card"><button class="avatar-picker" bindtap="chooseAvatar"><image wx:if="{{profile.avatar_file_id}}" src="{{profile.avatar_file_id}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else>{{profileInitial}}</text><text>更换头像</text></button><label class="field-label">昵称<input class="field-input" data-field="nickname" value="{{profile.nickname}}" bindinput="input"/></label><label class="field-label">所在城市<input class="field-input" data-field="city" value="{{profile.city}}" bindinput="input"/></label><label class="field-label">周末偏好<textarea class="field-textarea short" data-field="bio" value="{{profile.bio}}" bindinput="input"/></label><view class="field-label">出发节奏</view><view class="chip-row"><block wx:for="{{paces}}" wx:key="*this"><button class="chip {{profile.pace===item?'active':''}}" data-field="pace" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="pick">{{item}}</button></block></view><button class="secondary-btn photo-btn" bindtap="addPhoto">添加介绍照片（最多 6 张）</button><view class="photo-grid"><block wx:for="{{profile.photo_file_ids}}" wx:key="*this"><view class="photo-cell"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removePhoto">×</button></view></block></view><view class="two-actions profile-save"><button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="cancelEdit">取消</button><button class="primary-btn" loading="{{saving||uploading}}" bindtap="saveProfile">保存主页</button></view></view></block></view>